                    "value": "These trophies recognize real-world milestones—like celebrating half a century of collaboration between the Los Angeles Lakers and Toyota—and everyday retail executions that drive actual business for Smart & Final. We design campaigns to solve specific marketing challenges within the real boundaries of our clients' business dynamics, rather than chasing industry fads.",
